{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object visible, move, take, check properties, perform task; else scan, move. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectSize    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectWeight    /> <Action ID = MoveToFindObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToAnotherLocation    /> <Action ID = ScanForObjects    /> <SubTree ID = PerformTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    />",
